I had a similar experience the first and ONLY time I ever tried orange
sunshine. 
I became convinced that there was nothing more to learn or to experience;
that I had seen and done everything and from that point on, I would never
have another NEW experience. Looking back at this, some 20 years later, I
often think that all my husband (then-husband) would have had to do was to
take me to some movie I hadn't seen. But he said I was acting pretty strange
-- self-destructive; desperately unhappy; vocal about it -- and he was afraid
one or both of us might end up arrested or committed. 

Anyway, I was around 18 then. At 19 (still married), I felt old, old, old.
